coupling scale reads 30000000 * chat(n+1) + 1704000 ≥ 27832800 * chat n. Under the exact coupling
(D * dhat(n+1) = Q * dhat n + D * chat n), the launch cap (dhat 0 ≥ 1000000) and the source cap
