coupling scale reads 30000000 * chat(n+1) + 462900 ≥ 28424100 * chat n. Under the exact coupling
(D * dhat(n+1) = Q * dhat n + D * chat n), the launch cap (dhat 0 ≥ 1000000) and the source cap
(chat 0 ≥ 39000), EVERY admissible integer trajectory still crosses the budget head by window
123: sumTo dhat 123 ≥ 1744064. Certificate: 1543 is the maximal integer deficit for which the
sliding-window squeeze closes; at deficit 1543 + 1 the raw floor chain falls short. The floor
