integer pair (source, response) at both caps that satisfies the coupling exactly and the
floor law perturbed by a per-window deficit of 10402299 (coupling scale: +24965517600), yet stays
under the budget head: sumTo d 93 = 1526000 ≤ 1541354. Together with forcingUnderError1 (which
holds over ALL admissible trajectories for every deficit up to the certificate tolerance),
this brackets the adversarial error tolerance of the geometric mechanism at the anchor. -/
